{
  // 只用来做类型检查（npm run types），不编译、不输出文件。
  // Scope: ALL .js of every game (games/*/**) except its assets and tests (public, tests, art, docs, shots), and the engine examples packages/engine/examples/.
  // A list of known folders used to be here: a game with another folder (landmarks/, data/) was never type-checked and `check` still said passed.
  // three.js 的类型来自 @types/three（引擎包的依赖，版本跟 three 对齐），THREE.* 是真类型，不是 any。
  // 引擎自己的 .js 不在 include 里，游戏代码通过 packages/engine/index.d.ts 拿到引擎接口的类型
  // Engine .js that the examples import (threedog/tsl's render/fx/*.tsl.js, render/cascades.tsl.js and the files they import) is still
  // checked and its errors count like any other. The rest of the engine .js is not checked yet: including core/modules/render/ui gives about
  // 1560 errors (2026-11-03, mostly untyped `this` fields and option objects), too many to fix in one go; that is the one known gap.
  // （games 里 import 'threedog'，经 workspace 链接和 package.json 的 types 找到它；示例用相对路径 ../../index.js）。
  // 目录布局见 packages/tools/paths.mjs；改布局时这里的 include 要一起改。
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "strict": false,
    // 打开 noImplicitAny 只为抓 home[0] 这类"拿数字下标读 three 对象"的错（Vector3 没有下标，否则静默成 any 再变 NaN）；
    // 其余 7xxx 隐式 any 的报错在 packages/tools/types.mjs 里过滤掉，不要求游戏代码到处标类型
    "noImplicitAny": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    // 不跳过 .d.ts：引擎自己的声明（index.d.ts、types/）也要查——跳过时里面引用了不存在的类型名会悄悄变成 any
    "skipLibCheck": false,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": false,
    "types": []
  },
  "include": [
    "packages/engine/examples/**/*.js",
    "games/*/**/*.js",
    "games/*/**/*.d.ts",
    "packages/engine/index.d.ts",
    "packages/engine/types/**/*.d.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": ["**/node_modules", "**/dist", "**/.threedog", "games/*/vite.config.js", "games/*/public/**", "games/*/tests/**", "games/*/docs/**", "games/*/shots/**", "packages/engine/{core,modules,render,ui}/**/*.js", "packages/engine/index.js"]
}
